    38   *       acts as the root and is the last fallback in case none of its 
children was able to respond
    39   *       to a request.
    40   *   <li>The first level contains changes between different languages. 
Only the differences between
    41   *       a language and the language of the base bundle need to be 
handled by a language-specific
    42   *       {@code I18NBundle}.
    43   *   <li>The second level contains changes between different countries 
